From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 10:50:01 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Hand packets to the server thread without throwing

ensureMainThread posted the packet and then threw a shared exception for
NetworkManager to catch - an unwind for every play packet, about 400 a second
with 20 players and about 1% of the process. The handlers now call
postToMainThread and return when it answers true; ensureMainThread stays.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

